                    location (for example ``NXsample/temperature``, ``NXsample/electric_field``, an
                    ``NXsample/NXtransformations`` axis, or an ``NXbeam`` polarization field) and
                    linked here as an additional axis with its ``AXISNAME_indices`` set to 0, the
                    ``nP`` dimension. The application definition does not enumerate these
                    coordinates: any of them, including ones not listed here, is declared simply by
                    adding the field in its base-class location and wiring it into this group.
